  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_f4c37d87-7a29-47eb-a04f-9374e71e3af7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4;font-size:36px\"><em><strong>最具沉浸感的Minecraft第一人称射击体验</strong></em></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>3A级枪械操作与画面表现</strong></span> - 高度精致的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>射击</strong>、<strong>走位</strong></span>以及<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>检视</strong></span>动画</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>精心设计的枪械制作系统</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>使用配件改装你的武器</strong></span>，对生存模式十分友好！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>精细的模型与优化</strong></span> - 采用<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>LOD（细节层次）优化</strong></span>策略</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>兼容性</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>兼容绝大多数光影</strong></span>，放心畅玩！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>高度可定制</strong></span> - 可通过配置文件和数据JSON自由<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>自定义枪械数据</strong></span>！（需安装<span style=\"color:#0ff\"> <strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></strong></span>）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>成为创作者</strong></span> - 无需任何编程知识即可制作你自己的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>枪械包</strong></span>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>FPS性能优化</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>兼容<span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accelerated Rendering</a></span></strong></span>模组以提升帧数表现！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>生动的第三人称动画</strong></span> - <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>配合<span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player Animator</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">实现第三人称动画效果</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#7e8c8d\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">TaCZ由原TaC开发团队核心成员重组开发，完全重写了所有代码，重制了模型与动画，并新增及修改了大量功能</span></strong></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">现已支持1.20.1版本！</span></h2>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#6b43dc\"><strong>Discord 服务器</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我们强烈建议您加入我们的Discord服务器，以获取模组更新的第一手资讯。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ykPDSvR4Mz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_3425715f-70cf-428a-9b1e-9af51cf012a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"76\"></a><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/ykPDSvR4Mz\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处或点击图片</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#f60\"><strong>&nbsp;<em>功能特性</em></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2024/05/31/ILUHAr4dlNKJOvE.gif\" width=\"441\" height=\"247\"></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">独特的换弹与检视动画 - 每把枪械都独一无二！</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_995abbaa-ae11-451d-b80c-430c005a352c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"160\"></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用全新的配件界面改装你的武器</span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_07b26c1c-29ad-4fc3-89f2-7ffbaef0286a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"284\" height=\"212\"></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在专属工作台合成 - 对生存模式十分友好</span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsm.ms%252fimage%252ftzLwhK238vXTib6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2024/05/31/tzLwhK238vXTib6.gif\" alt=\"javaw.exe 2024.05.31 - 01.01.09.08.gif\" width=\"296\" height=\"166\"></a></span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">兼顾可视化与兼容性 - 全新瞄具视角实现方案</span></span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#e03e2d\"><em><strong>一周年纪念预告片</strong></em></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:600px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gp8jm7r_XZE\" width=\"600\" height=\"364\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>安装指南</strong></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">前置要求(Forge)：</span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> </span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">无需安装任何强制前置模组！</span></strong></span></span></span></h2>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>推荐安装：</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Player Animator</a></span> ：<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">优化第三人称动画</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span>( <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>强烈推荐！</strong></span> )</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Accelerated Rendering</a></span> ：<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">提升FPS性能</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span>( <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>强烈推荐！</strong></span> )</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Oculus</a></span> ：优化兼容性的模组</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>官方枪械包</strong></span></h1>\n<h3><strong>安装方法：(<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">1.0.3 发行版及更早版本</span>)</strong></h3>\n<p>打开 .minecraft 文件夹，进入“<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">config/tacz/custom</span>”目录，将 .zip 文件放入其中（无需解压），即可游玩。若未生效，请尝试在游戏中输入指令“/tacz reload”。</p>\n<h3><strong>安装方法：(<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.1.4 发行版及更新版本</span>)</strong></h3>\n<p>打开你的游戏版本文件夹，进入“<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">.minecraft/tacz</span>”目录，将 .zip 文件放入其中（无需解压），即可游玩。若未生效，请尝试在游戏中输入指令“/tacz reload”或“/reload”。</p>\n<h3><strong>注意事项：</strong></h3>\n<p>游戏内的自动转换系统不适用于非标准枪械包。如果您无法转换您的枪械包，请耐心等待该枪械包的作者更新至1.1.4版本，请勿联系我们。</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-cyber-armorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Cyber Armorer</a></strong></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-cyber-armorer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_bb3614c1-a77d-4534-bf65-f2023640c48a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"223\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Create Armorer</a></strong></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_4c50074d-2f55-489d-86a5-bef692655b71.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"398\" height=\"224\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-applied-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Applied Armorer</a></strong></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-applied-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_313aaa47-35bd-4698-b588-621548ea2e9e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"395\" height=\"222\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-immersive-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[下载] Immersive Armorer</a></strong></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-immersive-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_1b2b010c-be5a-4313-935e-63209f2502a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"294\"></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>支持我们</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e67e23\"><strong>&darr;&darr;&darr; 点击此处 (国际服) &darr;&darr;&darr;</strong></span>[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252f0VuqRck.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/0VuqRck.png</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/NekoCrane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/NekoCrane</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">&darr;&darr;&darr; 点击此处 (国内服) &darr;&darr;&darr;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[<span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_ecd5707f-8a0d-4b69-b75b-ed3107aa150b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"126\"></span></strong></span>](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fnekocrane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.net/a/nekocrane</a>)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>相关链接</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ced4d9\"><strong>相关模组/资源包：</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyes-steve-model\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yes Steve Model</a>]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hit-feedback\" rel=\"nofollow\">[命中反馈</a>]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/third-person-shooting\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的第三人称射击体验</a>]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins 战术装备</a>]<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-gucci-vuitton-attachments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[古驰与路易威登配件包]</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-fallout-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[辐射枪械包]</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-guns-lesraisins-append-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins 扩展包</a>]</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tac-sprint-tacz-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[<strong>TAC SPRINT</strong>]</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>社区枪械包</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>请按照说明安装枪械包，它们不是模组！</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_f31a878a-1f73-4cbc-bd12-55ee4be14d74.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"271\" height=\"271\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-helldivers2-gunpack-by-koei\" rel=\"nofollow\">地狱潜兵枪械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#353edb\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/WLzBAwh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"297\" height=\"167\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-gucci-attachments-by-koei\" rel=\"nofollow\">古驰配件包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HPUvsgU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"293\" height=\"163\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-tti-gunpack-by-koei\" rel=\"nofollow\">TTI 枪械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#353edb\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5046b882-768d-4b78-afc9-4078fa6f1d71.png\" width=\"311\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-the-division-gunpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">全境封锁枪械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_8f4fcb60-c223-46d2-9edb-17a7f95ba025.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"201\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-arip-attachments-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">ARIP 配件包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#353edb\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_34068921-5184-4c9b-b6ef-7df7cc8e2111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"296\" height=\"182\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-emx-arms-gunpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMX-Arms 枪械包]</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_0a89370c-14ff-4c33-a32f-90c8fcbb7bde.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"437\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">[<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-xiaomantou-gunpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">小馒头枪械包</a>]</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_768fe8db-a949-41bb-9f6f-33c92afc5d9c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-sanzu-no-kawa-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[三途川枪械包]</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_db19a025-4343-4402-880a-349070dc5992.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"181\"></